  "bio": "Anthony Tattoo, based in Málaga, Spain, is an adept tattoo artist primarily skilled in sketch, black&gray, and fineline styles. He also specializes in dotwork, geometric and blackwork styles, demonstrating a significant versatility in his craft. Anthony works out of the renowned Ohmycat Tattoo Studio and always maintains an open schedule ensuring he can cater to his clients' needs at any time.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Málaga, Andalucia, Spain\n\n▫️ Guest 18-23 June, Zurich🇨🇭 \n▪️ DOTWORK/GEOMETRIC/BLACKWORK\n▫️ @thetattooshire M Á L A G A\n▪️ Solicita presupuesto aquí ⬇️",
